asr-000146
00:39:19.069 --> 00:39:24.270
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: or around 2.5% compared to the P97.52 billion in 2024.

asr-000147
00:39:25.870 --> 00:39:28.470
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: Among the factors that declined in the gaming revenues in 2025 compared to the previous year

asr-000148
