asr-000152
00:39:45.829 --> 00:39:47.040
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: in the third quarter of the year 2020,

asr-000153
00:39:48.910 --> 00:39:50.359
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: also slowed down the income.

asr-000154
00:39:58.870 --> 00:40:05.894
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: The agency posted P106.03 billion in total income in 2025,

asr-000155
00:40:05.894 --> 00:40:10.470
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: lower by P5.68 billion compared to the P111.71 billion total income in 2024.

asr-000156
00:40:17.190 --> 00:40:21.829
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: PAGCOR's total contribution to nation-building reached P66.95 billion in 2025,

asr-000157
00:40:25.040 --> 00:40:27.570
PAGCOR Assistant Vice President Maria Cheryl I. De Guia: lower by P1.25 billion compared to the P68.20 billion contribution in 2024.

asr-000159
