01:00:12.119 --> 01:00:17.839
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So at 37 billion po across 10 years, ang dagdag po 3.7 billion per year.

asr-000342
01:00:17.839 --> 01:00:26.319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, Chairperson, para pong lumalabas, more or less P300 million a month

asr-000343
01:00:26.319 --> 01:00:28.200
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang aming kailangan bayaran.

asr-000344
01:00:28.200 --> 01:00:38.039
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya ito po ay makaka-apekto sa aming mga projects, sa aming mga pinagkakaloob na tulong

asr-000345
01:00:38.039 --> 01:00:44.799
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat P300 million, imbis na maitulong na natin yan sa nation-building,

asr-000346
01:00:44.799 --> 01:00:52.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kailangan ko pong ibaya d'yon dun sa utang namin na naging desisyon ng Korte Suprema.

asr-000347
01:00:52.079 --> 01:00:55.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I wish everyone to take note, yung kaso po in 1990,

asr-000348
01:00:55.520 --> 01:01:05.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 1993 pa. At ito po ay filed ni dating congressman Yeng Guiao,

asr-000349
01:01:05.119 --> 01:01:10.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naging congressman po yata siya dati, siya po ang nag-file noon noong 1993

asr-000350
01:01:10.920 --> 01:01:17.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at nito lang pong 2025 nagkaroon ng final ruling.

asr-000351
01:01:17.400 --> 01:01:25.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sabi ko nga po, hindi ko man po administration yan, eh talagang kailangan natin ipatupad.

asr-000352
01:01:25.599 --> 01:01:28.640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang utos ng Korte Suprema.

asr-000353
01:01:28.640 --> 01:01:30.839
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Salamat po, Chairperson.

asr-000354
01:01:30.839 --> 01:01:34.359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you po, Chairman Tengco, for the update.

asr-000355
01:01:34.359 --> 01:01:40.079
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So when we scrutinize the budget of the Philippine Sports Commission later on,

asr-000356
01:01:40.079 --> 01:01:46.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we'll make sure na yung additional remittances po na natatanggap nila ay nagagamit po talaga nila ng tama.

asr-000357
01:01:46.400 --> 01:01:49.559
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we'll take note po on the part of the Committee on Appropriations,

asr-000358
01:01:49.559 --> 01:01:56.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: just so when we deliberate on the PSC's budget, we'll make sure po, since almost double po,

asr-000359
01:01:56.000 --> 01:02:02.039
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yung natatanggap nila on a monthly, more than double on a monthly basis, yung natatanggap nila.

asr-000360
01:02:02.039 --> 01:02:06.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sana po nagagamit po talaga nila para tulungan po yung ating mga atleta.

asr-000361
01:02:06.920 --> 01:02:07.799
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Chair Al.

asr-000362
01:02:07.799 --> 01:02:11.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But I also would like to highlight, under contributions to nation building,

asr-000363
01:02:11.760 --> 01:02:17.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: despite the lower income, tumaas pa po yung socio-civic projects ninyo.

asr-000364
01:02:17.240 --> 01:02:27.079
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: From P12.4 billion in 2024 to P12.8 billion in 2025,

asr-000365
01:02:27.079 --> 01:02:31.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And to 13.99 billion in 2026.

asr-000366
01:02:31.520 --> 01:02:36.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we'd like to commend you on that as well po, that despite the downturn in the income,

asr-000367
01:02:36.480 --> 01:02:41.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: you still retain the commitments around socio-civic projects.

asr-000368
01:02:41.240 --> 01:02:45.039
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Chair, here, congress, dito po.

asr-000369
01:02:45.039 --> 01:02:51.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung clarificatory question sa talong mo kanina with regard to the payment sa Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-000370
01:02:51.640 --> 01:02:53.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: di ba, every year nagbabayad na sila.

asr-000371
01:02:53.880 --> 01:02:57.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ibig sabihin, matodoble ang...

asr-000372
01:02:57.680 --> 01:03:03.799
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi nagbayad na sila, contribution nila since 1993 sa National Treasury natin,

asr-000373
01:03:03.799 --> 01:03:06.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: at the same time, ngayon magbibigyan na ulit,

asr-000374
01:03:06.240 --> 01:03:09.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: kasama na yung binayad nila sa National Treasury.

asr-000375
01:03:09.880 --> 01:03:14.559
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ibig sabihin, doble-doble ang PSC ngayon, makukuha nila.

asr-000376
01:03:14.559 --> 01:03:16.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Congress, thank you very much.

asr-000377
01:03:16.160 --> 01:03:18.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Chair Al, may please respond to the query of representative...

asr-000378
01:03:18.760 --> 01:03:24.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: With your permission, Chairperson Suansing, I'd like to answer Congressman Presley.

asr-000379
01:03:24.880 --> 01:03:26.642
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Go ahead.

asr-000380
01:03:26.642 --> 01:03:36.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Congressman Presley, hindi lang po doble sapagkat, tulad po ng nabanggit ko kanina, Your Honor,

asr-000381
01:03:36.920 --> 01:03:40.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung dati pong contribution nung panahon na inabutan ko na,

asr-000382
01:03:40.960 --> 01:03:49.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nag-a-average po ng mga 180 to 190 million per month.

asr-000383
01:03:49.400 --> 01:03:56.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: With the Supreme Court ruling po, na five percent po ang mandato ng PAGCOR

asr-000384
01:03:56.119 --> 01:04:03.839
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa gross revenue, sa ngayon po, ay mahigit doble na po effective nung January 1,

asr-000385
01:04:03.839 --> 01:04:06.160
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung aming kinocontribute.

asr-000386
01:04:06.160 --> 01:04:09.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa ngayon po, eh, kung di ako nagkakamalik,

asr-000387
01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:12.839
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: umaabot po ng kulang 400 million na isang buwan.

asr-000388
01:04:12.839 --> 01:04:16.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero, over and above that, Your Honor,

asr-000389
01:04:16.920 --> 01:04:19.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pinagbabayad po kami ng Korte Suprema,

asr-000390
01:04:19.920 --> 01:04:24.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: retroactive 1993.

asr-000391
01:04:24.400 --> 01:04:26.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yun po, ay...

asr-000392
01:04:26.760 --> 01:04:28.680
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mag-a-average na naman ng kulang tatloon,

asr-000393
01:04:28.680 --> 01:04:33.240
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mahigit kumulang tatloon daang milyong piso po yung kada buwan.

asr-000394
01:04:33.240 --> 01:04:37.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya po, kung ito ay talagang may implement,

asr-000395
01:04:37.440 --> 01:04:42.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang magiging contribution po ng PAGCOR sa Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-000396
01:04:42.599 --> 01:04:48.640
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay aabutin po ng kulang 700 million piso bawat buwan.

asr-000397
01:04:48.640 --> 01:04:56.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ito po yung 5% na ngayon utos ng Korte Suprema sa gross revenue na magmumula,

asr-000398
01:04:56.480 --> 01:05:02.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: plus, yung binigyan po kami ng sampun taon lamang ng Korte Suprema

asr-000399
01:05:02.440 --> 01:05:09.200
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na bayaran yung pagkakautang ng PAGCOR magsimula po noong 1993.

asr-000400
01:05:09.200 --> 01:05:13.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Chair, I think we need to look into it, no?

asr-000401
01:05:13.760 --> 01:05:15.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi, doble-doble na budget ng PSA ngayon.

asr-000402
01:05:15.640 --> 01:05:20.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: With the payment for 3.3 billion every year for the next 10 years, ma'am,

asr-000403
01:05:20.200 --> 01:05:22.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that's sobra naman yan.

asr-000404
01:05:22.160 --> 01:05:25.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, imagine pag-court, karamihan talaga more on...

asr-000405
01:05:25.640 --> 01:05:29.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: namimigay sila, pero sobra naman kung ibibigay sa PSC yan.

asr-000406
01:05:29.240 --> 01:05:31.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I think we have to look into it, Madam Chair.

asr-000407
01:05:31.680 --> 01:05:32.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's it. Thank you very much.

asr-000408
01:05:32.680 --> 01:05:33.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Kong Presley.

asr-000409
01:05:33.960 --> 01:05:37.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Actually, I'm taking a look at the level,

asr-000410
01:05:37.480 --> 01:05:42.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the fiscal year 2027 NEP level for the PSC.

asr-000411
01:05:42.200 --> 01:05:47.319
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Medyo bumaba po siya in comparison to the 2026 GAA level,

asr-000412
01:05:47.319 --> 01:05:55.359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pero yung binaba po is not commensurate yet to the increase in the remittances from PAGCOR.

asr-000413
01:05:55.359 --> 01:06:00.839
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, we'll definitely scrutinize that on the part of the Committee on Appropriations

asr-000414
01:06:00.839 --> 01:06:10.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that whichever level we settle at Kong Presley for the final HGAB level of PSC,

asr-000415
01:06:10.680 --> 01:06:16.359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: talaga pong yung kailangan, whichever is sufficient based on their utilization

asr-000416
01:06:16.359 --> 01:06:21.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and based on the programs and projects that they have lined up for fiscal year 2027.

asr-000417
01:06:21.880 --> 01:06:22.119
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000418
01:06:22.119 --> 01:06:24.359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you po for pointing that out.

asr-000419
01:06:24.359 --> 01:06:26.284
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Chairperson, may I just make a...

asr-000420
01:06:26.284 --> 01:06:27.039
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: May I make a clarification?

asr-000421
01:06:27.039 --> 01:06:28.119
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, po. Chairperson, thank you.

asr-000422
01:06:28.119 --> 01:06:33.039
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung pong 37 billion, I'll be very candid here.

asr-000423
01:06:33.039 --> 01:06:36.720
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi pa po namin naumpisahang bayaran.

asr-000424
01:06:36.720 --> 01:06:42.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung pong sinasabi kong inumpisahan namin noong January 1, 2026,

asr-000425
01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:46.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay yung 5% of the gross revenue.

asr-000426
01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:51.279
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung pong, in fairness, yung pong halos 300 million naman,

asr-000427
01:06:51.279 --> 01:06:56.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung po ang pinag-uusapan namin pang kasalukuyan ni PSC,

asr-000428
01:06:56.119 --> 01:06:59.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: si Chairman Pato Gregorio, kung papano po.

asr-000429
01:06:59.000 --> 01:07:06.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I think we are close to coming up with an agreement very soon

asr-000430
01:07:06.440 --> 01:07:12.839
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para po nang sa ganun ay magamit na niya sa kanyang mga programa

asr-000431
01:07:12.839 --> 01:07:20.319
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung nasabing pagkakautang ng PAGCOR na na-rule ng Supreme Court with finality.

asr-000432
01:07:20.319 --> 01:07:21.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Chairman Tengco.

asr-000433
01:07:21.520 --> 01:07:25.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So if we may request po from the PAGCOR officials,

asr-000434
01:07:25.520 --> 01:07:31.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: copy of your remittances to the PSC if, kung pwede po,

asr-000435
01:07:31.760 --> 01:07:39.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: January, the whole of 2025, as well as 2026 from the start of the year to this year.

asr-000436
01:07:39.680 --> 01:07:45.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we can take that into account as we look through the budget of the Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-000437
01:07:45.400 --> 01:07:47.839
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po.

asr-000438
01:07:47.839 --> 01:07:52.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Those are my main clarificatory questions po.

asr-000439
01:07:52.400 --> 01:07:55.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll now open the floor to our distinguished colleagues.

asr-000440
01:07:55.920 --> 01:08:00.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: To post questions and comments to the PAGCOR family,

asr-000441
01:08:00.960 --> 01:08:03.799
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: may I respectfully remind our distinguished colleagues

asr-000442
01:08:03.799 --> 01:08:08.119
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that each member is given five minutes for questioning or interpolation,

asr-000443
01:08:08.119 --> 01:08:10.799
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: excluding the response of the resource persons.

asr-000444
01:08:10.799 --> 01:08:16.159
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And when you hear the bell sound, it means that you have 30 seconds to wind up your questions.

asr-000445
01:08:16.159 --> 01:08:20.719
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As part of the longstanding and respected tradition of the House of Representatives

asr-000446
01:08:20.719 --> 01:08:24.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to accord preferential treatment to the minority members of the House,

asr-000447
01:08:24.520 --> 01:08:25.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: followed by independence,

asr-000448
01:08:25.880 --> 01:08:29.279
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and majority members in an alternating manner,

asr-000449
01:08:29.279 --> 01:08:34.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that is how I will recognize our colleagues who have signed up for interpolations.

asr-000450
01:08:34.600 --> 01:08:39.359
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll start with the minority, then independent, then majority.

asr-000451
01:08:39.359 --> 01:08:44.199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And with that, we'll first start with the first member of the minority,

asr-000452
01:08:44.199 --> 01:08:46.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Representative Elijah San Fernando.

asr-000453
01:08:46.560 --> 01:08:48.759
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000454
01:08:48.759 --> 01:08:54.679
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Chair, thank ko sa presentation niyo po binanggit na 95 billion ng kita ng PAGCOR

asr-000455
01:08:54.679 --> 01:08:55.799
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng galing sa gaming.

asr-000456
01:08:55.799 --> 01:09:00.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At sa gaming operation, ilang percent po ito ng total income ng PAGCOR?

asr-000457
01:09:00.040 --> 01:09:08.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Iyan po ay halos, imingit ko mo lang, 95, 96 percent din po ng total income natin.

asr-000458
01:09:08.440 --> 01:09:15.239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Meron po ba tayong ballpark figure, ilan yung customers na pumapasok dito sa gaming operations,

asr-000459
01:09:15.239 --> 01:09:16.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: online gaming operations?

asr-000460
01:09:16.480 --> 01:09:26.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa online po, ang nakarehistro po na mga customers ay meron pong 30,

asr-000461
01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:31.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 30 million registered po yun.

asr-000462
01:09:31.000 --> 01:09:36.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung pong aktibong naglalaro, mga 10 million po.

asr-000463
01:09:36.400 --> 01:09:39.359
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung po yung active mismong naglalaro.

asr-000464
01:09:39.359 --> 01:09:45.759
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero ang nakarehistro po sa pangkasalukuyan, imingit ko mo lang po mga 30 million po.

asr-000465
01:09:45.759 --> 01:09:48.359
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair, thank ko.

asr-000466
01:09:48.359 --> 01:09:55.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nabanggit niyo po kanina, out of this 30 million registered and 10 million active players in online gaming,

asr-000467
01:09:55.440 --> 01:10:00.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: most of them ay nanggagaling sa CDE market. Tama po ba ito, Chair?

asr-000468
01:10:00.880 --> 01:10:06.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nandyan po yung malaking porsyento po, Congress.

asr-000469
01:10:06.560 --> 01:10:06.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you.

asr-000470
01:10:06.760 --> 01:10:07.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Your Honor.

asr-000471
01:10:07.520 --> 01:10:11.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So kapag pinag-usapan po natin itong market ng online gaming operation natin,

asr-000472
01:10:11.640 --> 01:10:18.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pinatutungkulan po natin dito mga manggagawa, particular, mga minimum wage earner, and low income earners po.

asr-000473
01:10:18.480 --> 01:10:19.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba?

asr-000474
01:10:19.400 --> 01:10:21.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po, Your Honor.

asr-000475
01:10:21.320 --> 01:10:22.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you.

asr-000476
01:10:22.400 --> 01:10:25.230
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong July 2025 po, may pinirmahan na memorandum.

asr-000477
01:10:25.230 --> 01:10:29.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong July 2025 po, may pinirmahan na memorandum of understanding ang PAGCOR at ang Adstandard Council.

asr-000478
01:10:29.600 --> 01:10:34.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi po dito, ang gambling ay pasok na doon sa must-screen category.

asr-000479
01:10:34.120 --> 01:10:40.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pwede niyo po bang ipaliwanag sa amin ano yung sakop ng must-screen category ng gambling?

asr-000480
01:10:40.000 --> 01:10:42.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano yung mga sakop po nito?

asr-000481
01:10:42.040 --> 01:10:52.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, noong 2025, ang PAGCOR po, isa sa mga programa niya sa Responsible Gaming,

asr-000482
01:10:52.960 --> 01:10:57.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang pakikipag-ugnayan po sa...

asr-000483
01:10:57.320 --> 01:10:58.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa Adstandard Council.

asr-000484
01:10:58.600 --> 01:11:06.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung napansin ninyo, at kung naalala ko po, hearing po rito rin ng budget,

asr-000485
01:11:06.480 --> 01:11:14.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hindi pa po namin napipirmahan yung aming pakikipag-ugnayan sa Adstandard Council

asr-000486
01:11:14.040 --> 01:11:20.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: noong huli pong hearing natin ng budget ng PAGCOR for year 2026.

asr-000487
01:11:20.719 --> 01:11:24.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang naganap po, at noon po naging isyong malaki,

asr-000488
01:11:24.880 --> 01:11:25.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung pong lahat ng...

asr-000489
01:11:25.920 --> 01:11:32.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung billboard halos sa buong Maynila at gayon din sa mga major tollways

asr-000490
01:11:32.440 --> 01:11:40.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay punong... nakita po ng nating lahat ay napakadami po sa mga billboard na ito

asr-000491
01:11:40.360 --> 01:11:44.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay nauukol sa online gaming.

asr-000492
01:11:44.440 --> 01:11:53.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya, ako po ay naalarma rin at sa pakikipag-ugnayan po natin sa Adstandard Council

asr-000493
01:11:53.040 --> 01:11:55.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nagkaroon po na ngayon ng panuntunan.

asr-000494
01:11:55.679 --> 01:11:58.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: O nagkaroon ngayon ng struktura.

asr-000495
01:11:58.480 --> 01:12:06.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung saan, una, hindi na po pwedeng mag-advertise ng lantaran

asr-000496
01:12:06.159 --> 01:12:13.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang anumang uri ng online gaming operator, sino man ito,

asr-000497
01:12:13.159 --> 01:12:16.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: gayon din naman po maski yung land-based casinos natin.

asr-000498
01:12:16.800 --> 01:12:20.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya, sometime po, binigil ako po ng...

asr-000499
01:12:20.800 --> 01:12:24.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung di ako nagkakamali,

asr-000500
01:12:24.040 --> 01:12:25.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 60 araw na palugit.

asr-000501
01:12:25.639 --> 01:12:27.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang lahat ng mga billboard na ito,

asr-000502
01:12:27.960 --> 01:12:32.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pero effective po noong September 2025,

asr-000503
01:12:32.320 --> 01:12:35.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naibaba na po natin lahat ito.

asr-000504
01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:40.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pangalawa, hindi na po pwedeng mag-advertise na lamang

asr-000505
01:12:40.400 --> 01:12:43.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang isang land-based operator,

asr-000506
01:12:43.280 --> 01:12:45.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: gayon din po, your honor,

asr-000507
01:12:45.199 --> 01:12:48.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang mga online gaming operators,

asr-000508
01:12:48.120 --> 01:12:54.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung hindi dumadaan sa Adstandard Council.

asr-000509
01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:56.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pangatlo po,

asr-000510
01:12:56.360 --> 01:13:00.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ipinagbawal na rin po ng Adstandard Council

asr-000511
01:13:00.080 --> 01:13:05.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang pag-a-advertise ng online gaming or land-based casino operations

asr-000512
01:13:05.440 --> 01:13:07.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: during prime time.

asr-000513
01:13:07.679 --> 01:13:16.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi na po sila pwedeng mag-advertise between 5 to 8 o'clock in the evening.

asr-000514
01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:17.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At ngayon po,

asr-000515
01:13:17.800 --> 01:13:24.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hindi na po maaari ka maglagay ng mga advertisement

asr-000516
01:13:24.800 --> 01:13:28.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na nagiging...

asr-000517
01:13:28.400 --> 01:13:29.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nakalalamang po ngayon

asr-000518
01:13:29.159 --> 01:13:33.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa mga advertisements na nakikita natin sa kapeligiran

asr-000519
01:13:33.920 --> 01:13:39.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay meron pong paalala tungkol sa responsible gaming.

asr-000520
01:13:39.960 --> 01:13:43.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, yun po ang pinakabalangkas

asr-000521
01:13:43.560 --> 01:13:46.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng pakikipagkasunduan po

asr-000522
01:13:46.520 --> 01:13:50.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng PAGCOR sa Adstandard Council.

asr-000523
01:13:50.120 --> 01:13:52.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair Al.

asr-000524
01:13:52.800 --> 01:13:57.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, binabanggit niyo po, hindi pa napirmahan.

asr-000525
01:13:57.360 --> 01:13:59.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nung pong isang taong nag-i-hearing tayo,

asr-000526
01:13:59.400 --> 01:14:01.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi pa po na...

asr-000527
01:14:01.280 --> 01:14:02.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero ngayon po,

asr-000528
01:14:02.280 --> 01:14:05.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ipinatutupad na po nila ngayon sa pangkasalukuyan.

asr-000529
01:14:05.400 --> 01:14:07.159
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Salamat, Chair Al.

asr-000530
01:14:07.159 --> 01:14:08.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaugnay po nito,

asr-000531
01:14:08.040 --> 01:14:12.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: naglabas ng ASC Circular 2025-010

asr-000532
01:14:12.000 --> 01:14:16.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: all gambling advertisements in all forms

asr-000533
01:14:16.560 --> 01:14:19.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: must be secured by ASC prior to implementation.

asr-000534
01:14:19.320 --> 01:14:20.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba ito?

asr-000535
01:14:20.080 --> 01:14:20.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Are you aware of this?

asr-000536
01:14:20.600 --> 01:14:21.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tama po, Your Honor.

asr-000537
01:14:21.639 --> 01:14:22.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang totoo po,

asr-000538
01:14:22.840 --> 01:14:25.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung makikita nyo yung mga current advertisements,

asr-000539
01:14:25.520 --> 01:14:29.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ngayon ng mga online gaming operators,

asr-000540
01:14:29.080 --> 01:14:33.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: gayon din po ang mga land-based operations.

asr-000541
01:14:33.440 --> 01:14:36.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron na po nakalagay sa ilalim,

asr-000542
01:14:36.000 --> 01:14:39.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ASC, Adstandard Council,

asr-000543
01:14:39.960 --> 01:14:41.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: may numero po,

asr-000544
01:14:41.600 --> 01:14:45.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yun po ang pagpapatunay na dumaan ito sa kanila

asr-000545
01:14:45.920 --> 01:14:49.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para masuri kung tama po ba yung content

asr-000546
01:14:49.920 --> 01:14:52.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng billboard or anumang pong uri

asr-000547
01:14:52.400 --> 01:14:54.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng advertisement ang pinatutupad nila.

asr-000548
01:14:54.360 --> 01:14:55.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair Al.

asr-000549
01:14:55.480 --> 01:14:56.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000550
01:14:56.320 --> 01:14:56.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Bago po.

asr-000551
01:14:56.680 --> 01:15:06.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sir, bago pumunta sa ASC, yung mga advertisers kailangan po munang dumaan sa inyo at makasecure ng approval for advertising. Tama po ba ito, Chair Al?

asr-000552
01:15:06.520 --> 01:15:23.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tama po, Your Honor. Ang nangyayari po ngayon, nauuna po sa amin at halos sabay pong nag-a-apply sa amin o hiningin na approval sa amin, ngayon din po sa Ad Standards Council.

asr-000553
01:15:23.120 --> 01:15:42.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair Al. Maraming salamat po sa clarification. So lahat ng porma ng advertising, may it be billboard, online o kahit saan pa, dapat po mag-secure muna ng AA sa PAGCOR bago sila pumunta sa ASC para makakuha ng clearance para makapag-advertise.

asr-000554
01:15:42.560 --> 01:15:55.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po kayo, Your Honor. Ngayon po, Madam Chair, ang malaking problema po natin, nagkalat po yung mga content creator.

asr-000555
01:15:55.080 --> 01:16:08.239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na nagpo-promote ng online gambling. At ito pong mga content creator na ito, hindi sumusunod doon sa regulation as set by PAGCOR and the Ad Standards Council.

asr-000556
01:16:08.239 --> 01:16:19.239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Halimbawa, pinakasikat po, Ivana Alawi, mamimigay ng isang daang iPhone 17 pero hindi pala kusang ibibigay yun.

asr-000557
01:16:19.239 --> 01:16:26.639
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dapat, ikaw muna ay mag-subscribe o mag-like doon sa isang online gaming.

asr-000558
01:16:26.639 --> 01:16:39.719
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At wala po kahit saan dito yung pagsunod doon sa sinasabi po na pinag-uusapan natin kanina, Ad Standards Council, authority, merong approval po mula sa PAGCOR.

asr-000559
01:16:39.719 --> 01:16:48.199
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi rin po nakalagay. Halimbawa, ito pong isang to, isang sikat to, si Osas. Galawang Osas bata. Millions of followers po to.

asr-000560
01:16:48.199 --> 01:16:55.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Wala po kahit saan dyan na nakasulat na gambling can be addictive. Know when to stop.

asr-000561
01:16:55.080 --> 01:17:09.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: My question po, Madam Chair, is paano po ini-implement o ini-exercise ng PAGCOR ang kanyang regulatory power over these content creators and influencers?

asr-000562
01:17:09.480 --> 01:17:15.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Madam Chairperson, I will, with your permission, I would like to answer.

asr-000563
01:17:15.600 --> 01:17:22.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Congressman San Fernando, una po, totoo po yun.

asr-000564
01:17:22.600 --> 01:17:24.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron pong sumusunod.

asr-000565
01:17:24.639 --> 01:17:27.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron pong hindi sumusunod.

asr-000566
01:17:27.679 --> 01:17:42.766
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang akin pong gustong talakayin sa umagang ito ay yung pinunan ninyo na lumabas na ang isang online endorser tulad ni Ivana.

asr-000567
01:17:42.766 --> 01:17:44.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Okay.

asr-000568
01:17:44.600 --> 01:17:50.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa harap ninyo at sasagutin ko pong hindi po sila himingi ng permiso.

asr-000569
01:17:50.639 --> 01:17:54.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ano po ang ginawa ng PAGCOR?

asr-000575
01:17:54.040 --> 01:18:08.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We fined the online gaming company 1 million pesos and together with that, gave them a stern warning na hindi na dapat maulit ito.

asr-000576
01:18:08.760 --> 01:18:24.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung maulit ito, heavier fine and the possibility that it can lead, another violation can lead to the suspension and ultimately the cancellation of their license.

asr-000577
01:18:24.440 --> 01:18:27.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So yan po, naipatupad namin.

asr-000578
01:18:27.120 --> 01:18:39.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nagbayad po sila ng isang milyong piso at minanduhan din po namin sila, Your Honor, na ihintuna yung nasabing promosyo na yon.

asr-000579
01:18:39.560 --> 01:18:49.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pangalawa, meron po kayong pinakita rin na posas rosas.

asr-000580
01:18:49.000 --> 01:18:54.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, marami po dyan ay hindi.

asr-000581
01:18:54.400 --> 01:18:57.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: May mga licensee ng PAGCOR.

asr-000582
01:18:57.560 --> 01:19:03.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hanggang sa mga oras na ito, may halos tumatabla lang po.

asr-000583
01:19:03.760 --> 01:19:09.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% ng nag-ooperate ay may lisensya ng PAGCOR.

asr-000584
01:19:09.320 --> 01:19:14.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% po naman ay illegal.

asr-000585
01:19:14.520 --> 01:19:23.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya ang akin po, kung wala pong tinutukoy dyan, hindi po kamukano kay Ivana kanina, Your Honor, na inyong tinukoy.

asr-000586
01:19:23.480 --> 01:19:29.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nag-identify siya ng online gaming operator.

asr-000587
01:19:29.320 --> 01:19:31.444
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Legal po yun.

asr-000588
01:19:31.444 --> 01:19:41.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron po kaming karapatang mag-issue ng isang warning at magpabayad ng fine.

asr-000589
01:19:41.639 --> 01:19:46.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero gusto ko pong liwanagin sa membro ng committee ito,

asr-000590
01:19:46.840 --> 01:19:49.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kayo din naman sa ating buting chairperson,

asr-000591
01:19:49.960 --> 01:19:51.868
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na,

asr-000592
01:19:51.868 --> 01:20:10.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nung ako po yung nag-assume ng chairmanship ng PAGCOR,

asr-000593
01:20:10.800 --> 01:20:15.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay halos nasa 8 to 10% pa lang po ang legal noon.

asr-000594
01:20:15.719 --> 01:20:21.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero with our reforms, with the structure that we have set up,

asr-000595
01:20:21.000 --> 01:20:29.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: medyo nakaangat na po at sa ngayon ang aming pong paniwala ay nasa halos tabla na po 50-50.

asr-000596
01:20:29.600 --> 01:20:38.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero hindi pa po, Congressman San Fernando, mahinto yung illegal online gaming operators.

asr-000597
01:20:38.480 --> 01:20:43.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At ang masama po rito, wala po sa Pilipinas sila.

asr-000598
01:20:43.080 --> 01:20:50.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po ay nasa abroad na gumagamit ng mga influencers ng mga kaibigan.

asr-000599
01:20:50.440 --> 01:20:50.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kapabayan natin.

asr-000600
01:20:50.920 --> 01:20:53.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair Al. Doon sa paglilinaw na yun.

asr-000601
01:20:53.400 --> 01:21:00.159
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, malinaw na po na illegal itong karamihan ng mga online sugal.

asr-000602
01:21:00.159 --> 01:21:05.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano po yung mga pamamaraan para mapanagot natin itong mga content creator

asr-000603
01:21:05.560 --> 01:21:09.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na walang habas na makapag-promote ng online sugal?

asr-000604
01:21:09.480 --> 01:21:13.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi, Madam Chair, pinag-uusapan natin itong mga content creator na ito.

asr-000605
01:21:13.960 --> 01:21:16.239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: By the millions ang kanilang follower.

asr-000606
01:21:16.239 --> 01:21:20.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At ina-identify nila, Chair Al, ito pong mga...

asr-000607
01:21:20.920 --> 01:21:21.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: online gaming site.

asr-000608
01:21:21.960 --> 01:21:27.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Say, for example, 1365, tapos PeriaPlay.

asr-000609
01:21:27.120 --> 01:21:30.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, ito, paano po kaya natin mapapanagot itong mga content creator na ito?

asr-000610
01:21:30.400 --> 01:21:35.011
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tulad po yung binanggit nyo na yun, hindi po license yun ng PAGCOR.

asr-000611
01:21:35.011 --> 01:21:36.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Okay.

asr-000612
01:21:36.400 --> 01:21:41.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, Madam Chairperson, with your permission, I would like to answer this.

asr-000613
01:21:41.520 --> 01:21:47.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Congressman San Fernando, Your Honor, gusto ko pong ibigay alam sa inyo,

asr-000614
01:21:47.280 --> 01:21:49.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa pakikipag-ugnayan po ng PAGCOR,

asr-000615
01:21:49.840 --> 01:21:57.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa DICT, sa NTC, at sa CICC.

asr-000616
01:21:57.600 --> 01:22:01.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Marami na po kaming, sa pamamagitan nila,

asr-000617
01:22:01.719 --> 01:22:04.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng mga ahensyang nabanggit ko,

asr-000618
01:22:04.320 --> 01:22:07.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: idinimanda sa Korte.

asr-000619
01:22:07.440 --> 01:22:14.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat maliwanag po na pinatawag po at kinausap po ng CICC

asr-000620
01:22:14.600 --> 01:22:19.573
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang mga endorsers na yun at winardigan sila.

asr-000621
01:22:19.573 --> 01:22:19.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nahinagpala.

asr-000622
01:22:19.840 --> 01:22:30.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi na po sila pwede mag-endorse ng mga illegal or non-PAGCOR licenses.

asr-000623
01:22:30.920 --> 01:22:36.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya meron na po silang pangkaso, kung hindi ako nagkakamali,

asr-000624
01:22:36.600 --> 01:22:41.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: himigit ko buo lang po sa mga labing limang endorsers at top endorsers

asr-000625
01:22:41.920 --> 01:22:47.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang habla na po at ongoing na po yung mga kaso nila.

asr-000626
01:22:47.040 --> 01:22:48.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And in fairness,

asr-000627
01:22:48.800 --> 01:22:50.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron pong,

asr-000628
01:22:50.159 --> 01:22:56.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: magagaling at maraming follower na mga content creators or endorsers

asr-000629
01:22:56.600 --> 01:22:59.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang voluntaryo na pong umatras

asr-000630
01:22:59.600 --> 01:23:05.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at hindi na po sila nag-i-endorso ng mga illegal na site.

asr-000631
01:23:05.120 --> 01:23:06.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Marami po sa kanila,

asr-000632
01:23:06.840 --> 01:23:07.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: your honor,

asr-000633
01:23:07.920 --> 01:23:12.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: lumipat na po sa mga legal operators.

asr-000634
01:23:12.320 --> 01:23:14.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kami po naman,

asr-000635
01:23:14.320 --> 01:23:16.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: walang police power,

asr-000636
01:23:16.000 --> 01:23:20.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: wala po kami magawa kung hindi mag-recommenda lamang

asr-000637
01:23:20.120 --> 01:23:22.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa DICT,

asr-000638
01:23:22.199 --> 01:23:23.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa NTC,

asr-000639
01:23:23.679 --> 01:23:26.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: gayon din naman sa CICC

asr-000640
01:23:26.080 --> 01:23:31.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng mga inaakala naming dapat ay maparusahan.

asr-000641
01:23:31.040 --> 01:23:34.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Salamat po, Chair Al, dun sa sinabi nyo.

asr-000642
01:23:34.000 --> 01:23:37.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kailangan po na mapanagot dahil equally liable

asr-000643
01:23:37.280 --> 01:23:40.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: itong mga content creator at influencer na to

asr-000644
01:23:40.480 --> 01:23:42.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa pagkalulong sa sugal

asr-000645
01:23:42.840 --> 01:23:45.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng mga manggagawa at ordinaryong Pilipino.

asr-000646
01:23:45.520 --> 01:23:47.239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Before I wind up, Madam Chair,

asr-000647
01:23:47.239 --> 01:23:48.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gusto ko lang po maitanong,

asr-000648
01:23:48.400 --> 01:23:49.352
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa corporate operating business,

asr-000649
01:23:49.352 --> 01:23:50.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Eto ang mga ating budget niyo,

asr-000650
01:23:50.560 --> 01:23:54.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ilang porsyento po dito ang nakalaan para sa

asr-000651
01:23:54.360 --> 01:23:54.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: dun sa mga

asr-000652
01:23:54.840 --> 01:23:57.851
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: social harm na tinatawag?

asr-000653
01:23:57.851 --> 01:23:59.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo,

asr-000654
01:23:59.320 --> 01:24:00.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ngayon po,

asr-000655
01:24:00.320 --> 01:24:02.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa taong 2026,

asr-000656
01:24:02.920 --> 01:24:05.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naging aktibo po ang PAGCOR

asr-000657
01:24:05.960 --> 01:24:09.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: dito sa game,

asr-000658
01:24:09.560 --> 01:24:12.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mga responsible gaming projects po.

asr-000659
01:24:12.719 --> 01:24:15.120
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang nakalaan po namin na budget

asr-000660
01:24:15.120 --> 01:24:19.010
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at hindi po kinukuha sa amin mismo,

asr-000662
01:24:19.320 --> 01:24:28.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung hindi sa tulong ng iba't-ibang foundations ng mga kasinos and licenses namin.

asr-000663
01:24:28.000 --> 01:24:33.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron pong budget na ginagamit una.

asr-000664
01:24:33.440 --> 01:24:38.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Gusto kong ibalita at noong isang taon ay hindi pa rin ito nagaganap.

asr-000665
01:24:38.520 --> 01:24:44.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kailan lang ay may 24-7 hotline na po ang PAGCOR.

asr-000666
01:24:44.159 --> 01:24:51.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung saan, yan po ay makikita nyo na sa maraming billboards all over the country.

asr-000667
01:24:51.360 --> 01:25:01.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 24-7 hotline kung saan ang mga nalululong po sa sugal ay meron na pong pwedeng tawagan at makonsulta.

asr-000668
01:25:01.440 --> 01:25:07.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: May partner po ang PAGCOR dyan, ang Seagulls Flock Foundation.

asr-000669
01:25:07.960 --> 01:25:13.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po ay may karanasan sa mga rehabilitation ng mga nalulululong.

asr-000670
01:25:13.960 --> 01:25:32.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At sa kasalukuyan, aktibo po ito ang meron pong 6 sa bawat 12-hour shift na mga customer agents na sumasagot dito sa hotline na ito.

asr-000671
01:25:32.440 --> 01:25:40.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At gusto ko pong ipagbigay alam sa inyo, noong umpisa po ay siguro nahihiya pa yung mga gamers.

asr-000672
01:25:40.840 --> 01:25:44.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero sa ngayon po, nagtala na kami

asr-000673
01:25:44.360 --> 01:25:50.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nitong nakaraang dalawang buwan, nang humigit-kumulang sa isang daang katao,

asr-000674
01:25:50.719 --> 01:25:56.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang amin ang natulungan sa pagbibigay ng advice,

asr-000675
01:25:56.639 --> 01:26:03.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron na pong mga nai-refer sa rehabilitation centers para po nga sa Responsible Gaming Acts.

asr-000676
01:26:03.679 --> 01:26:08.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po, your honor, sa mga billboards na nakikita natin,

asr-000677
01:26:08.960 --> 01:26:15.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: marami na po kayong makikita ngayon na nandyan na po yung hotline.

asr-000678
01:26:15.360 --> 01:26:26.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Bukod talagang full billboard, hiningan po natin ng tulong yung ating licenses para po ma-disseminate yung information sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-000679
01:26:26.080 --> 01:26:36.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, patuloy po ang mga programa namin, lalo't higit na, your honor, yung self-exclusion.

asr-000680
01:26:36.360 --> 01:26:41.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ngayon pa lang po, sa panahon ng PAGCOR, na aktibo ngayon,

asr-000681
01:26:41.400 --> 01:26:49.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pwede nang ang isang nalululong sa sugal ay pwede nang sumulat sa amin,

asr-000682
01:26:49.560 --> 01:26:58.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kasama ang kanyang pamilya, pwede na rin i-request na pagbawalan ang isang kapamilya nila

asr-000683
01:26:58.679 --> 01:27:02.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: o mismo yung tao na makapagsugal.

asr-000684
01:27:02.000 --> 01:27:07.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At gusto ko pong ipagbigay alam sa lahat,

asr-000685
01:27:07.159 --> 01:27:12.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 15,000 na po ang naaprobahan ng mga,

asr-000686
01:27:12.080 --> 01:27:17.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang PAGCOR in the last year for self-exclusion.

asr-000687
01:27:17.880 --> 01:27:26.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang ibig sabihin po nito, your honor, sila po, naka-alerto na po ang lahat ng land-based casinos natin

asr-000688
01:27:26.360 --> 01:27:31.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at ganyan din po naman yung ating online licenses.

asr-000689
01:27:31.040 --> 01:27:40.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nang sa ganon, hindi po pwede nang makapasok at makapagsugal yung inaprobahan po ng PAGCOR

asr-000690
01:27:40.400 --> 01:27:47.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na nag-apply ng tinatawag na self or family exclusion.

asr-000691
01:27:47.320 --> 01:28:01.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yan po, your honor, ay parte ng aming mga programang ginagawa para nga po matulungan natin yung ating mga kababayan na nalululong sa sugal.

asr-000692
01:28:01.119 --> 01:28:03.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000693
01:28:03.320 --> 01:28:07.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ito pong mga tinanong ko dahil nabanggit niyo po kanina,

asr-000694
01:28:07.400 --> 01:28:09.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang market po kasi ay CDE.

asr-000695
01:28:09.800 --> 01:28:18.679
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang pinaka-vulnerable po dito sa pagkalulong sa sugal, lalong-lalo na sa online sugal, ay ang mga manggagawa at ordinaryong Pilipino.

asr-000696
01:28:18.679 --> 01:28:25.199
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Totoo po, nasasabihin ng marami na personal na choice kung ikaw ay magsusugal o hindi.

asr-000697
01:28:25.199 --> 01:28:35.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero para sa isang gipit na manggagawa, makikita niya halimbawa si Ivana Alawi, si Vice Ganda, si Vic Soto na magpo-promote ng sugal,

asr-000698
01:28:35.560 --> 01:28:43.199
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: aakalain nila na pwede naman pala kaming magsugal para lang makatawid dito sa aming bahay.

asr-000699
01:28:43.199 --> 01:28:46.119
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya ko po ito pinapatungkulan, Madam Chair,

asr-000700
01:28:46.119 --> 01:28:51.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil napakalaking issue po ang online sugal sa bansa natin.

asr-000701
01:28:51.880 --> 01:28:57.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Marami po ang nalululong, marami pong mga manggagawa, ang nagsasangla.

asr-000702
01:28:57.800 --> 01:29:02.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dating may kotse, ngayon may motor. Dating may motor, hahatakin yung motor.

asr-000703
01:29:02.360 --> 01:29:07.639
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So kailangan maging equally liable itong mga influencer, content creator,

asr-000704
01:29:07.639 --> 01:29:18.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pati na rin yung kanilang mga mother company, yung mga kumpanya na pinopromote nila dahil grabe po ang social harm at social cost ng pagkalulong sa sugal.

asr-000705
01:29:18.560 --> 01:29:31.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At Madam Chair, natutuwa po ako dahil kaisa po natin ang PAGCOR, binanggit po na merong commitment para sawatahin itong mga online influencer at content creator na nagpopromote,

asr-000706
01:29:31.320 --> 01:29:37.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: walang habas na nagpopromote ng online sugal. Yun lamang po Madam Chair, maraming salamat po.

asr-000707
01:29:37.560 --> 01:29:48.239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Representative San Fernando.

asr-000708
01:29:48.239 --> 01:29:57.040
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Madam Chair. May we acknowledge Deputy Minority Leader Jeremy Jet Nisay, Vice Chair Lolita Javier,

asr-000709
01:29:57.040 --> 01:30:05.639
Committee Secretary: Javier, Deputy Majority Leader Hill Tabarangay Jr. Acosta, Representative Rolando Valeriano,

asr-000710
01:30:05.639 --> 01:30:13.119
Committee Secretary: Vice Chair Jose "Bong" Jr. Teves, Deputy Minority Leader Jesus "Bong" Suntay, Vice Chair Bernadette

asr-000711
01:30:13.119 --> 01:30:21.840
Committee Secretary: Barbers, Deputy Minority Leader Shielo Crissel-Lagman, Representative Mario Cocoy-Salvador, Representative

asr-000712
01:30:21.840 --> 01:30:26.400
Committee Secretary: Liodi Odi-Tariela, Vice Chair Maria Cristina Talavera-Lopez, Representative Citi Amina

asr-000713
01:30:26.400 --> 01:30:34.800
Committee Secretary: DiMaporo, Deputy Majority Leader Mica Gonzalez, Vice Chair Loreto Amante, Vice Chair Arne

asr-000714
01:30:34.800 --> 01:30:41.880
Committee Secretary: Fern-DeBella, and Representative Mica Gonzalez, and also Representative Julius Cesar Vergara.

asr-000715
01:30:41.880 --> 01:30:43.119
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Your Honors.

asr-000716
01:30:43.119 --> 01:30:45.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, ComSec.

asr-000717
01:30:45.040 --> 01:30:49.199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I now move to our next interpellator from the majority?

asr-000718
01:30:49.199 --> 01:30:50.199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Representative?

asr-000719
01:30:50.199 --> 01:30:57.159
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Representative Bong Teves Jr.

asr-000720
01:30:57.159 --> 01:31:00.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-000721
01:31:00.360 --> 01:31:09.858
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Madam Chair, fellow colleagues, PAGCOR family, headed by Chairman Alejandro Tengco, pleasant

asr-000722
01:31:09.858 --> 01:31:14.719
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: good morning.

asr-000723
01:31:14.719 --> 01:31:24.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair, ay Madam Chair, meron ba tayong breakdown ng income ng PAGCOR?

asr-000724
01:31:24.960 --> 01:31:30.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, meron ka nandun po sa ating ulat.

asr-000725
01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:31.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Hindi ko siya mabasa rito eh.

asr-000726
01:31:31.840 --> 01:31:33.880
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: But anyway, pakibigyan na lang ako.

asr-000727
01:31:33.880 --> 01:31:45.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And then, nasa page 4 po, upper portion, nandun po yung comparable results of operations for 2025,

asr-000728
01:31:45.760 --> 01:31:53.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: which was actual, Your Honor, 2026 estimated po, sapagkat kalahati ang palamputay ng taon,

asr-000729
01:31:53.400 --> 01:31:56.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at saka yung projected po for 2027.

asr-000730
01:31:56.840 --> 01:32:01.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: No, I need the breakdown ng income ng PAGCOR.

asr-000731
01:32:01.840 --> 01:32:06.760
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Parang example, STL, magkano ba na kukontribute ng STL sa atin?

asr-000732
01:32:06.760 --> 01:32:08.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi po sa amin ng STL, Your Honor.

asr-000733
01:32:08.679 --> 01:32:10.287
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ay, ay, ay, sorry, sorry.

asr-000734
01:32:10.287 --> 01:32:11.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa PCS, o po yun, Your Honor.

asr-000735
01:32:11.560 --> 01:32:17.494
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Yung sa online gaming, magkano ba na kukontribute natin?

asr-000736
01:32:17.494 --> 01:32:19.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Hindi.

asr-000737
01:32:19.040 --> 01:32:20.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo.

asr-000738
01:32:20.760 --> 01:32:22.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We will furnish you one.

asr-000739
01:32:22.360 --> 01:32:30.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But from the gaming operations po, in page 4, kung inyo pong makikita,

asr-000740
01:32:30.400 --> 01:32:31.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang estimated po,

asr-000741
01:32:31.560 --> 01:32:35.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay kulang 80 billion pesos.

asr-000742
01:32:35.080 --> 01:32:41.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halos sa ngayon po, Your Honor, nakalalamang na ng konti yung online gaming.

asr-000743
01:32:41.840 --> 01:32:47.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, halos sabihin na po natin, tabla siya sa around 50% po,

asr-000744
01:32:47.920 --> 01:32:56.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay nagmumula sa land-based casinos, at 50% po, ay nagmumula sa online gaming.

asr-000745
01:32:56.520 --> 01:33:00.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kung titignan nyo po yung ulat,

asr-000746
01:33:00.679 --> 01:33:07.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: halos 40 billion pesos po, ang inaasahang maging kita ng online gaming,

asr-000747
01:33:07.800 --> 01:33:17.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at pagkatapos po naman, 40 billion din po, ang maging kita ng land-based casino licenses po natin, Your Honor.

asr-000748
01:33:17.199 --> 01:33:19.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay.

asr-000749
01:33:19.520 --> 01:33:25.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Based sa report, 2024 is 111 billion tayo, diba?

asr-000750
01:33:25.840 --> 01:33:27.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tama po, Your Honor.

asr-000751
01:33:27.040 --> 01:33:30.299
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: And then, based sa report, 2025 is 165.

asr-000752
01:33:30.299 --> 01:33:31.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 166 billion.

asr-000753
01:33:31.719 --> 01:33:32.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000754
01:33:32.800 --> 01:33:34.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bumaba tayo.

asr-000755
01:33:34.840 --> 01:33:42.060
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Bumaba po ito dahil effective po noong 2025, pinagbawal na po yung POGO.

asr-000756
01:33:42.060 --> 01:33:42.600
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: POGO, yes.

asr-000757
01:33:42.600 --> 01:33:44.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo.

asr-000758
01:33:44.159 --> 01:33:46.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ayan po ay nawalam po tayo.

asr-000759
01:33:46.679 --> 01:33:54.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Projected for 2025, mga 10 billion piso po ang nawala po sa atin noon, Your Honor.

asr-000760
01:33:54.280 --> 01:33:57.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ano ang paraan para bumalik natin ito?

asr-000761
01:33:57.560 --> 01:33:59.920
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Meron ba tayong mga naisip na pamamaraan na po?

asr-000765
01:33:59.920 --> 01:34:03.760
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Meron ba tayong mga naisip na pamamaraan ng PAGCOR para bumalik ang nawawala na pamalit ng POGO?

asr-000768
01:34:03.760 --> 01:34:06.480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Pero legal?

asr-000771
01:34:06.480 --> 01:34:14.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa ngayon po, talagang nagkoconcentrate po ang PAGCOR, Your Honor sa...

asr-000772
01:34:14.760 --> 01:34:18.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ...pagpapalakas ng online gaming.

asr-000773
01:34:18.480 --> 01:34:19.808
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat, sa pangkasalukuyan,

asr-000774
01:34:19.808 --> 01:34:21.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nasa sa 50% lang po ang nakaka-capture na market natin,

asr-000775
01:34:21.800 --> 01:34:27.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ...nasa sa 50% lang po ang naka-capture na market natin,

asr-000776
01:34:27.760 --> 01:34:38.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang tinutukoy ko po, limampung porsyento po ng industriya ng online gaming ay legal, limampung porsyento po ay iligal.

asr-000777
01:34:38.440 --> 01:34:49.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, doon po, ang aming mga programa talaga ay papano mahikayat yung mga iligal na maging legal.

asr-000778
01:34:49.800 --> 01:34:57.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagat sabi ko nga eh, because of the advances of technology, napakahirap na po talagang maalis itong online gaming.

asr-000779
01:34:57.920 --> 01:35:03.239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Eh, ang aming po ang kinukonsentratan ngayon is papano mahikayat.

asr-000780
01:35:03.239 --> 01:35:16.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At maganda naman po ang nagiging resulta, meron na po ilang malalaking iligal na online gaming operators na gusto na po mag-apply sa PAGCOR ng lisensya.

asr-000781
01:35:16.000 --> 01:35:18.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, una pong hakbang yan.

asr-000782
01:35:18.000 --> 01:35:26.600
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pangalawa po, pinalalakas din po ng PAGCOR ngayon yung tinatawag na Special Class BPO.

asr-000783
01:35:26.600 --> 01:35:28.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung saan?

asr-000784
01:35:28.320 --> 01:35:39.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang ating pong bansa ay kilalang napakalakas sa industriya ng business processing outsourcing.

asr-000785
01:35:39.280 --> 01:35:52.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Eh, nakita po namin, Your Honor, marami pong backroom operations ng malalaking mga land-based operations at online gaming operations abroad.

asr-000786
01:35:52.280 --> 01:35:58.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang pwede pong dito na sa Pilipinas magkaroon ng backroom operations.

asr-000787
01:35:58.360 --> 01:36:08.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Gusto ko pong bigay na halimbawa ang isa sa pinakamalaking kasino sa buong mundo, MGM.

asr-000788
01:36:08.400 --> 01:36:13.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Nandito na po ang backroom operations nila, Your Honor, sa Pilipinas.

asr-000789
01:36:13.400 --> 01:36:21.080
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At dito na po ang kanilang HR, accounting, at saka yung mga graphics design ginagawa.

asr-000790
01:36:21.080 --> 01:36:29.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron pong humigit kumulang dalawang milyong, eh, dalawang libong empleyadong Pilipino na po.

asr-000791
01:36:29.960 --> 01:36:46.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At bukod po ron, tinatarget po namin na ito ay palakasin ng sa ganon, una, makapagdagdag po ng trabaho sa ating kapwa Pilipino na nangangailangan ng trabaho sa pangkasalukuyan.

asr-000792
01:36:46.760 --> 01:36:52.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As a BPO worker, hindi po ito sumesweldo ng minimum wage.

asr-000793
01:36:52.000 --> 01:36:58.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang sweldo po nito ay nasa sa range ng P35,000 to P50,000.

asr-000794
01:36:58.639 --> 01:37:10.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At pangalawa, meron pong additional revenue ang PAGCOR sapagkat ibat-ibang uri po ng fees ang nakukulikta namin sa kanila.

asr-000795
01:37:10.639 --> 01:37:24.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, inaasahan ko po na by 2026, meron pong humigit kumulang mga 2.5 hanggang 3 billion piso po

asr-000796
01:37:24.920 --> 01:37:31.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang maaring umakyat na revenue.

asr-000797
01:37:31.719 --> 01:37:43.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, yun po ang pang-neutralize natin dito sa nangyayaring paghina ng land-based operations at saka ng online gaming po, Your Honor.

asr-000798
01:37:43.360 --> 01:37:48.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000799
01:37:48.000 --> 01:37:59.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Madam Chair, tulad ng sinabi ni Congressman Ili ng Manggagawa,

asr-000800
01:37:59.400 --> 01:38:03.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: maraming kabataan ang nalululong sa online, hindi lang kabataan.

asr-000801
01:38:03.560 --> 01:38:06.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ano ba ang mga proseso natin para mabawasan ito?

asr-000802
01:38:06.400 --> 01:38:10.119
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Or, ano ang dapat natin gawin?

asr-000803
01:38:10.119 --> 01:38:12.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kasi meron akong nakikita rito,

asr-000804
01:38:12.560 --> 01:38:18.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: isa sa mga income ng PAGCOR at isa sa mga initiative ng PAGCOR

asr-000805
01:38:18.360 --> 01:38:26.599
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: na ginagawa ninyo ay magpagawa ng mga school building.

asr-000806
01:38:26.599 --> 01:38:30.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Nakalagay dito, nationwide school building program.

asr-000807
01:38:30.040 --> 01:38:30.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay?

asr-000808
01:38:30.360 --> 01:38:31.760
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay.

asr-000809
01:38:32.000 --> 01:38:37.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Nakikita yung inyong mga tarpulin na gawa ng PAGCOR

asr-000810
01:38:37.440 --> 01:38:42.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ng mga estudyante, kabataan, elementary and high school.

asr-000811
01:38:42.280 --> 01:38:48.159
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Sasabi nila, ay, galing sa PAGCOR yung school building namin, magtataya kami sa online.

asr-000812
01:38:48.159 --> 01:38:50.920
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Yes. Kasi iba yung produkto ng pag-iisip ngayon.

asr-000813
01:38:50.920 --> 01:38:52.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Di ba nakikita natin ngayon?

asr-000814
01:38:52.960 --> 01:38:57.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Nakita lang natin sa mga TV, kung saan-saan,

asr-000815
01:38:57.520 --> 01:39:01.199
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: na yung social media natin, napakabilis.

asr-000816
01:39:01.199 --> 01:39:02.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Nagdala-dala ng mga baril yung kabataan.

asr-000817
01:39:02.520 --> 01:39:04.159
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Namamaril na namamaral.

asr-000818
01:39:04.159 --> 01:39:04.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Namamaril.

asr-000819
01:39:04.800 --> 01:39:06.639
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ganun din ang nakikita ko rito.

asr-000820
01:39:06.639 --> 01:39:11.880
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bakit hindi natin palitan ito ng mga programa na mga katulong pa?

asr-000821
01:39:11.880 --> 01:39:15.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: May suggestion na, Madam Chair,

asr-000822
01:39:15.440 --> 01:39:20.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: bakit instead of school building program ang ilagawa natin,

asr-000823
01:39:20.040 --> 01:39:24.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: bakit hindi natin sundin yung gusto nang mangyari ng ating Pangulo

asr-000824
01:39:24.520 --> 01:39:30.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: during SONA, na sinabi niya magpapagawa siya ng maraming evacuation center

asr-000825
01:39:30.280 --> 01:39:32.119
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: na mas efektibo.

asr-000827
01:39:32.119 --> 01:39:37.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kaysa makikita ng mga kabataan na yung pala school building gawa ng PAGCOR

asr-000828
01:39:37.960 --> 01:39:40.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: galing sa sugal ng online, tataya kami.

asr-000829
01:39:40.800 --> 01:39:42.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Siguro, pag-alala natin ito.

asr-000830
01:39:42.960 --> 01:39:47.119
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Baka sakaling mas magandang evacuation center na lang ang ipagawa natin

asr-000831
01:39:47.119 --> 01:39:51.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa mga typhoon prone area na talaga namang kailangan ngayon

asr-000832
01:39:51.080 --> 01:39:55.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: at binanggit ito ng ating Pangulo during SONA.

asr-000833
01:39:55.560 --> 01:40:01.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At pangalawa, wala po akong nakikita rito na pundo

asr-000834
01:40:01.000 --> 01:40:02.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: para sa information.

asr-000835
01:40:02.080 --> 01:40:07.159
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Dissemination program sa mga schools, elementary and high schools

asr-000836
01:40:07.159 --> 01:40:13.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: para ang pagsusugal ay hindi tama, lalong-lalong na sa kabataan

asr-000837
01:40:13.040 --> 01:40:14.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: para ma-prevent natin sila.

asr-000838
01:40:14.800 --> 01:40:16.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Prevention ang kailangan natin.

asr-000839
01:40:16.800 --> 01:40:21.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kasi hindi lang namang po matatanda o may edad

asr-000840
01:40:21.400 --> 01:40:23.599
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang mga nagsusugal, kundi kabataan.

asr-000841
01:40:23.599 --> 01:40:26.719
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Maraming kabataan na nagsusugal ngayon.

asr-000842
01:40:26.719 --> 01:40:29.599
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kinakikita nyo sa iba-iba, lalo sa Metro Manila.

asr-000843
01:40:29.599 --> 01:40:30.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bakit?

asr-000844
01:40:30.280 --> 01:40:32.639
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kasi nakikita ko po rito,

asr-000845
01:40:32.639 --> 01:40:33.679
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: itong information dissemination.

asr-000846
01:40:33.679 --> 01:40:36.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Napakaganda po ng programa natin.

asr-000847
01:40:36.040 --> 01:40:42.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Meron, namimigay tayo ng transport vehicle sa mga pasyente,

asr-000848
01:40:42.360 --> 01:40:45.159
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: mga food packs during a calamity.

asr-000849
01:40:45.159 --> 01:40:47.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bakit instead of school building,

asr-000850
01:40:47.560 --> 01:40:51.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang gawin na lang natin ay evacuation center na lang.

asr-000851
01:40:51.520 --> 01:40:55.480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At idagdag natin ang information dissemination campaign

asr-000852
01:40:55.480 --> 01:40:58.199
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa mga eskwilahan, magdagdag tayo ng pundo.

asr-000853
01:40:58.199 --> 01:41:01.679
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: It's my suggestion, Mr. Chair.

asr-000854
01:41:01.679 --> 01:41:06.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, we will take note of your suggestions.

asr-000855
01:41:06.599 --> 01:41:10.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, we do not have, but maybe,

asr-000856
01:41:10.599 --> 01:41:13.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: gusto ko lang pong banggitin dito.

asr-000857
01:41:13.960 --> 01:41:16.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Isa po talaga sa programa ng PAGCOR,

asr-000858
01:41:16.000 --> 01:41:19.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung pagpapatuloy na magpagawa ng mga evacuation centers.

asr-000859
01:41:19.639 --> 01:41:23.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero it has been overcome by the memorandum of agreement

asr-000860
01:41:23.800 --> 01:41:27.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: that we have signed with the Department of Education.

asr-000861
01:41:27.520 --> 01:41:29.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil, tunay po nana,

asr-000862
01:41:29.320 --> 01:41:33.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Napakalaki din ang backlog ng mga classrooms natin, Your Honor.

asr-000863
01:41:33.960 --> 01:41:41.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya minarapat na rin po ng Administrasyon pangasulukuyan na talagang ito o not,

asr-000864
01:41:41.000 --> 01:41:44.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bigyan na ng pansin yung pagpapagawa ng mga eskwelahan.

asr-000865
01:41:44.199 --> 01:41:58.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero we will consider your suggestions and, Your Honor, we will see how we can balance your suggestion with our current programs.

asr-000866
01:41:58.199 --> 01:42:05.920
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Madam Chair. Lastly, what is the status of PAGCOR Casino Privatization Initiatives?

asr-000867
01:42:05.920 --> 01:42:14.599
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Paano natin itong magiging efektibo sa ating revenue at sa pagkakawala ng maraming trabano?

asr-000868
01:42:14.599 --> 01:42:19.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Salamat po sa katanungan niyo, Congressman Odi.

asr-000869
01:42:19.760 --> 01:42:27.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sa pangasulukuyan po ay iniintay na lang po ng PAGCOR ang desisyon ng GCG.

asr-000870
01:42:27.520 --> 01:42:38.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Or yung Governance Commission for GOCCs na isumiti na po namin ang aming mga datos na hiningi nila.

asr-000871
01:42:38.159 --> 01:42:46.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At sila po bilang nasa sa ilalim kami ang siyang magre-rekomenda sa tanggapan ng Pangulo

asr-000872
01:42:46.360 --> 01:42:51.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung pagpapatuloy po ng tinatawag na privatization or decoupling.

asr-000873
01:42:51.199 --> 01:42:58.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang balita ko po ay baka po hindi marating ang last quarter.

asr-000874
01:42:58.000 --> 01:43:02.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Magkaroon na po ng desisyon tungkol dito.

asr-000875
01:43:02.119 --> 01:43:08.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tunay po kasing napakabigat na rin ang kargan ng Casino Filipino, Your Honor.

asr-000876
01:43:08.400 --> 01:43:14.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil sa panahon pong ako ay nanunungkulan sa PAGCOR,

asr-000877
01:43:14.360 --> 01:43:21.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: napanglaki na po ng lugi ng Casino Filipino branches po namin.

asr-000878
01:43:21.400 --> 01:43:25.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya wala na po talagang dapat gawin kung hindi.

asr-000879
01:43:25.719 --> 01:43:28.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I-unload na po ito sa pribadong sektor.

asr-000880
01:43:28.960 --> 01:43:36.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, we are just waiting for the recommendation of GCG to the Office of the President.

asr-000881
01:43:36.520 --> 01:43:42.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And as I said, we were told it will be coming out very soon.

asr-000882
01:43:42.159 --> 01:43:46.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tungkol naman po sa maapekto ang mga empleyado,

asr-000883
01:43:46.280 --> 01:43:53.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ako po ay imikot na halos sa lahat ng ating mga Casino Filipino sites sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-000884
01:43:53.880 --> 01:43:58.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At pinaliwanag ko po sa lahat ng empleyado maapekto ham.

asr-000885
01:43:58.040 --> 01:44:04.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Na una, yung kanila pong retirement ay babayaran.

asr-000886
01:44:04.440 --> 01:44:12.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pangalawa, bukod po sa regular retirement, magkakaroon po ng tinatawag na special incentive package.

asr-000887
01:44:12.760 --> 01:44:18.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung saan, because of the involuntary nature of the retirement,

asr-000888
01:44:18.159 --> 01:44:23.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: magkakaroon po ng karagdagang retirement package aside from retirement.

asr-000889
01:44:23.599 --> 01:44:30.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Di normal retirement package ang isang maapekto hang empleyado ng PAGCOR.

asr-000890
01:44:30.760 --> 01:44:36.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dito sa nasabing decoupling privatization na ito.

asr-000891
01:44:36.880 --> 01:44:41.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chairman. Madam Chair, thank you very much.

asr-000892
01:44:41.840 --> 01:44:50.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At ang TJP Partylist, pakunguna po ni Vice Chairman ng Appropriation at ng Deputy Majority of Bung Tebes

asr-000893
01:44:50.560 --> 01:44:53.239
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ay palaging sumusuporta sa PAGCOR.

asr-000894
01:44:53.239 --> 01:44:54.100
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you very much.

asr-000895
01:44:54.100 --> 01:44:55.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Panaming salam.

asr-000896
01:44:55.080 --> 01:45:02.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Panaming salamat din po, Your Honor.

asr-000897
01:45:02.159 --> 01:45:04.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Representative Bong Teves.

asr-000898
01:45:04.920 --> 01:45:11.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll now move to our next interpellator from the minority, Representative Sarah Elago.

asr-000899
01:45:11.480 --> 01:45:14.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you, Madam Chair. Good morning.

asr-000900
01:45:14.599 --> 01:45:18.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: A few clarificatory questions on the nationwide school building program,

asr-000901
01:45:18.639 --> 01:45:24.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: notwithstanding, of course, the concerns raised by our fellow legislators.

asr-000902
01:45:24.280 --> 01:45:28.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The initial funding stated here is 1.37 billion pesos.

asr-000903
01:45:28.920 --> 01:45:38.679
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Is this for the year? O kasama na po yung for next year din?

asr-000904
01:45:38.679 --> 01:45:43.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, baka po, anong page po ba yan?

asr-000905
01:45:43.159 --> 01:45:45.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ganito po yan.

asr-000906
01:45:45.520 --> 01:45:50.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: In our memorandum of agreement with the Department of Education

asr-000907
01:45:50.760 --> 01:45:55.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: signed by myself and Secretary Sunny Angara,

asr-000908
01:45:55.440 --> 01:46:02.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we will be funding the construction of 125 buildings

asr-000909
01:46:02.040 --> 01:46:08.446
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and 3-story, 12-classroom school buildings,

asr-000910
01:46:08.446 --> 01:46:11.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the total amount of which,

asr-000911
01:46:11.199 --> 01:46:16.239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: including the equipment and furnitures like the chairs,

asr-000912
01:46:16.239 --> 01:46:20.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: will be roughly about 7.5 billion pesos.

asr-000913
01:46:20.920 --> 01:46:30.501
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So that will be the equivalent of about 1,500 classrooms.

asr-000914
01:46:30.501 --> 01:46:31.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: They are...

asr-000915
01:46:31.679 --> 01:46:32.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: They will be equipped...

asr-000916
01:46:32.880 --> 01:46:35.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I mean, they will have furnitures already,

asr-000917
01:46:35.599 --> 01:46:38.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: like the student chairs and tables.

asr-000918
01:46:38.880 --> 01:46:44.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: They will have the 75-inch TVs in every classroom

asr-000919
01:46:44.119 --> 01:46:50.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and meron pong amplifier yung teacher and so on and so forth.

asr-000920
01:46:50.760 --> 01:47:00.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So that program, Your Honor, will be for the period 2026 up to the end of 2027.

asr-000921
01:47:00.199 --> 01:47:01.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: We will be...

asr-000922
01:47:01.480 --> 01:47:07.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: It will be the Department of Education that will be vetting and recommending

asr-000923
01:47:07.480 --> 01:47:11.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: the school building that will be constructed

asr-000924
01:47:11.440 --> 01:47:18.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and it will be PAGCOR through the different LGUs that will be funding the construction.

asr-000925
01:47:18.800 --> 01:47:24.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So for this year, as the process has already started,

asr-000926
01:47:24.440 --> 01:47:29.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we have earmarked close to about 3.5 billion pesos

asr-000927
01:47:29.440 --> 01:47:30.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: to pay for the construction of the school buildings.

asr-000928
01:47:30.480 --> 01:47:34.871
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: For the 50% down payment that we will release

asr-000929
01:47:34.871 --> 01:47:38.239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: to the different local government units

asr-000930
01:47:38.239 --> 01:47:43.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and then there will be a series of progressive billing payments

asr-000931
01:47:43.159 --> 01:47:54.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: that we will make dependent on the completion of every school building.

asr-000932
01:47:54.080 --> 01:47:54.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-000933
01:47:54.800 --> 01:47:59.119
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: We'll just request PAGCOR to submit to this committee a breakdown

asr-000934
01:47:59.119 --> 01:48:02.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: of the...

asr-000935
01:48:02.320 --> 01:48:07.679
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: utilization of these funds for the nationwide school building program.

asr-000936
01:48:07.679 --> 01:48:09.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So malinaw po, no?

asr-000937
01:48:09.480 --> 01:48:14.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: DepEd ang mag-be-vet, mag-identify, magkitiyak kung saan po mapupunta

asr-000938
01:48:14.599 --> 01:48:17.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: itong mga classrooms na dagdag na nais nating magawa.

asr-000939
01:48:17.880 --> 01:48:19.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maliwanag po yun, Your Honor.

asr-000940
01:48:19.599 --> 01:48:21.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At kanina ngayon may mga nagtatunong,

asr-000941
01:48:21.760 --> 01:48:26.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pati po sa bidding, wala pong pakialam ang PAGCOR.

asr-000942
01:48:26.360 --> 01:48:30.377
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang PAGCOR po ay magpo-pondo lamang.

asr-000943
01:48:30.377 --> 01:48:35.734
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: There are so many requirements between the Department of Education

asr-000944
01:48:35.734 --> 01:48:39.883
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and the local government unit concerned.

asr-000945
01:48:39.883 --> 01:48:43.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: PAGCOR basically collates all of them.

asr-000946
01:48:43.639 --> 01:48:52.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And between myself and the LGU or the district concerned,

asr-000947
01:48:52.360 --> 01:48:54.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron po memorandum of agreement.

asr-000948
01:48:54.880 --> 01:48:59.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And then we shall release the first funds

asr-000949
01:48:59.440 --> 01:49:09.644
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: of the budget to the respective LGUs who will take charge of the bidding process.

asr-000950
01:49:09.644 --> 01:49:09.952
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, Chair.

asr-000951
01:49:09.952 --> 01:49:10.904
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Your Honor.

asr-000952
01:49:10.904 --> 01:49:11.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes.

asr-000953
01:49:11.520 --> 01:49:15.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung pondo po natin magagaling dito sa Fund for Social Civic Projects.

asr-000954
01:49:15.800 --> 01:49:16.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000955
01:49:16.360 --> 01:49:17.199
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Is this correct?

asr-000956
01:49:17.199 --> 01:49:18.566
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000957
01:49:18.566 --> 01:49:18.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

asr-000958
01:49:18.880 --> 01:49:21.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now let me go to the...

asr-000959
01:49:21.080 --> 01:49:24.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I'd like to follow through on questions

asr-000960
01:49:24.320 --> 01:49:26.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: with regard to the regulation on gambling ads.

asr-000961
01:49:26.599 --> 01:49:28.239
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit niyo po kanina na meron,

asr-000962
01:49:28.239 --> 01:49:32.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kayong mga napatawa ng fines.

asr-000963
01:49:32.639 --> 01:49:34.075
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit niyong halimbawa,

asr-000964
01:49:34.075 --> 01:49:35.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: one million pesos.

asr-000965
01:49:35.040 --> 01:49:38.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero for the past months,

asr-000966
01:49:38.440 --> 01:49:41.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasinimulan niyo po itong mas mahigpit ninyo na regulation,

asr-000967
01:49:41.760 --> 01:49:43.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: magkano na yung buong nakolekta?

asr-000968
01:49:43.599 --> 01:49:47.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At saan yung ginagamit ito?

asr-000969
01:49:47.119 --> 01:49:51.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang nakolekta na po namin since 2026,

asr-000970
01:49:51.719 --> 01:49:56.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron na po sigurong mayigit isandang milyong piso.

asr-000971
01:49:56.000 --> 01:49:58.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ito po, it forms part of the other income.

asr-000972
01:49:58.840 --> 01:50:02.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: As stated in our statement.

asr-000973
01:50:02.040 --> 01:50:09.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At yan po ay nasasama po sa corporate income natin.

asr-000974
01:50:09.000 --> 01:50:15.679
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung saan that is distributed as listed in our presentation, Your Honor.

asr-000975
01:50:15.679 --> 01:50:21.159
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit niyo rin kanina na meron na tayong mga nakasuhan.

asr-000976
01:50:21.159 --> 01:50:25.159
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede ba kaming humingi ng listahan ng mga nakasuhan niyo na

asr-000977
01:50:25.159 --> 01:50:27.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at kung meron na bang nanagot,

asr-000978
01:50:27.599 --> 01:50:29.239
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron na bang nasuspindi,

asr-000979
01:50:29.239 --> 01:50:35.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: meron na bang nakansela ang license dahil dito sa stricter rules ninyo?

asr-000980
01:50:35.800 --> 01:50:39.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, binanggit ko po kanina,

asr-000981
01:50:39.159 --> 01:50:44.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung nakasuhan ay hindi po nagmula sa PAGCOR.

asr-000982
01:50:44.199 --> 01:50:51.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang nagkaso po laban dito sa mga nababanggit kanina pang mga endorsers or influencers

asr-000983
01:50:51.920 --> 01:50:54.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay nagmula po sa CICC.

asr-000984
01:50:54.800 --> 01:50:57.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kami po ay naguulat sa kanila,

asr-000985
01:50:57.599 --> 01:51:06.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at sila po ang nagpa-file ng kaso laban sa mga influencers na ito.

asr-000986
01:51:06.199 --> 01:51:13.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang pagkakaalam ko po, halos simigit kumulang po yata yung labing dalawa or labing lima na yung na-file na nila ng kaso.

asr-000987
01:51:13.520 --> 01:51:16.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, sa inyong kahilingan, Your Honor,

asr-000988
01:51:16.760 --> 01:51:21.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hihingi po kami ng listahan mula sa CICC

asr-000989
01:51:21.560 --> 01:51:25.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: which we can forward to the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-000990
01:51:25.480 --> 01:51:27.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, all the members are updated.

asr-000991
01:51:27.880 --> 01:51:34.796
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dito po sa isinasagawang operasyon, laban po dito sa mga endorsers na ito.

asr-000992
01:51:34.796 --> 01:51:35.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Alright.

asr-000993
01:51:35.679 --> 01:51:44.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Meron bang mas pinalakas din na hakbang para habulin naman itong foreign gambling companies na illegal ho na nag-operate dito?

asr-000994
01:51:44.440 --> 01:51:52.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kasi you mentioned only for the local endorsers, influencers, but what about those companies?

asr-000995
01:51:52.360 --> 01:51:58.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tulad po ng nabanggit ko kanina, Your Honor, wala po kaming police powers.

asr-000996
01:51:58.000 --> 01:52:04.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, we are dependent on DICT, CICC, and NTC.

asr-000997
01:52:04.639 --> 01:52:11.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po, alam ko eh, nakipag-ugnayan na rin sa lahat ng social media platforms.

asr-000998
01:52:11.199 --> 01:52:24.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sumulat na po sila sa mga pinuno nito para ipagbigay alam na hindi pinahintulutan dito sa ating bansa yung mga nasabing gawain na yon.

asr-000999
01:52:24.400 --> 01:52:27.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang balita ko po eh, personal nang sumulat,

asr-001000
01:52:27.599 --> 01:52:44.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang ating DICT Sekretary, Sekretary Henry Aguda, sa mga heads na rin ng mga social media platforms na yon para ipagbigay alam yung nasabing ating mga batas dito.

asr-001001
01:52:44.199 --> 01:52:48.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, maraming salamat. We'll follow this through with the DICT and CICC.

asr-001002
01:52:48.520 --> 01:52:49.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001003
01:52:49.719 --> 01:52:54.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, Madam Chair, with regard to the 24-7 National Problem Gambling Helpline,

asr-001004
01:52:54.520 --> 01:52:57.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakakasimula lang at nararapat lang na meron talagang takbo.

asr-001005
01:52:57.920 --> 01:53:02.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mga kababayan natin na may gambling-related issues and concerns.

asr-001006
01:53:02.520 --> 01:53:05.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero para sa taong ito at sa susunod na taon,

asr-001007
01:53:05.639 --> 01:53:09.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nabanggit nyo kanina na meron kayong partner na non-profit.

asr-001008
01:53:09.920 --> 01:53:12.199
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero sa bahagi naman ng pamahalaan,

asr-001009
01:53:12.199 --> 01:53:19.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron ba tayong proposed din na budget para matiyak na meron tayong regular at sustenido na pondo

asr-001010
01:53:19.320 --> 01:53:26.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para sa pagpapatakbo mismo at pagpapanatili ng helpline na ito?

asr-001011
01:53:26.440 --> 01:53:27.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor,

asr-001012
01:53:27.560 --> 01:53:31.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: with regard to a budget coming from the national government,

asr-001013
01:53:31.679 --> 01:53:34.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: I am not aware that there is one.

asr-001014
01:53:34.560 --> 01:53:39.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: But I just want to state this to the committee,

asr-001015
01:53:39.560 --> 01:53:47.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: that PAGCOR will definitely make sure that these initiatives continue to be practiced.

asr-001016
01:53:47.320 --> 01:53:52.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I am committing here under my administration,

asr-001017
01:53:52.440 --> 01:53:55.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hindi po mahihinto ang programang ito.

asr-001018
01:53:55.320 --> 01:53:56.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi naman po napakalaking.

asr-001019
01:53:56.960 --> 01:53:58.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halaga, Your Honor.

asr-001020
01:53:58.800 --> 01:54:07.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya makakaasa po kayo na baka hindi na natin kailangan pang ipaabot ito sa national agencies

asr-001021
01:54:07.760 --> 01:54:10.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat naniniwala po ako, Your Honor,

asr-001022
01:54:10.520 --> 01:54:20.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na kaya po na mapondohan ito ng PAGCOR katulong mismo yung mga legal licenses natin

asr-001023
01:54:20.079 --> 01:54:23.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa pamamagitan po ng mga foundations.

asr-001024
01:54:23.840 --> 01:54:25.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Gusto ko pong ipagbigay alam,

asr-001025
01:54:25.400 --> 01:54:29.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bago rin pong initiative ng PAGCOR,

asr-001026
01:54:29.560 --> 01:54:36.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: dati po kasi ang may foundation lamang ay yung mga integrated resources natin.

asr-001027
01:54:36.840 --> 01:54:45.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 2% po ng gross gaming revenue nila ay inalalaan sa mga iba't ibang projects

asr-001028
01:54:45.320 --> 01:54:54.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na nakatutulong sa health at saka sa sports and education.

asr-001029
01:54:54.679 --> 01:54:57.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So ngayon po,

asr-001030
01:54:57.800 --> 01:55:04.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: we have started, we did replicate that very successful program.

asr-001031
01:55:04.800 --> 01:55:07.239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kaya ngayon po, Your Honor,

asr-001032
01:55:07.239 --> 01:55:13.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 1% po ng gross gaming revenue ng online gaming platforms

asr-001033
01:55:13.320 --> 01:55:18.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay kailangan na rin isantabi nila para sa pagkakawang gawa

asr-001034
01:55:18.719 --> 01:55:25.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at para masuportahan lahat ng ating mga responsible gaming projects.

asr-001035
01:55:25.000 --> 01:55:26.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So,

asr-001036
01:55:26.960 --> 01:55:32.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: laking bagay po nun para masustinahan lahat po nitong mga ginagawa natin

asr-001037
01:55:32.639 --> 01:55:40.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para nga ma-neutralize itong mga nagaganap na pagkalulong ng ilan sa ating mga kababayan

asr-001038
01:55:40.079 --> 01:55:42.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dito sa online gambling.

asr-001039
01:55:42.560 --> 01:55:43.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-001040
01:55:43.280 --> 01:55:46.079
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano ang nakalaan na pondo para rito?

asr-001041
01:55:46.079 --> 01:55:49.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Katulad ng sinabi niyo, hindi lang helpline ang sakop.

asr-001042
01:55:49.280 --> 01:55:52.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din para sa support for counseling.

asr-001043
01:55:52.639 --> 01:55:52.971
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Opo.

asr-001044
01:55:52.971 --> 01:55:55.891
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: You also mentioned prevention and awareness campaign.

asr-001045
01:55:55.891 --> 01:55:57.051
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, how much is allowed?

asr-001046
01:55:57.051 --> 01:55:57.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: It's allotted for this.

asr-001047
01:55:57.800 --> 01:55:59.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, sa ngayon po eh,

asr-001048
01:55:59.599 --> 01:56:03.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: humigit kumulang sa isandang medium piso po sa isang taon

asr-001049
01:56:03.400 --> 01:56:10.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nakabudget sa iba't ibang uri ng mga programa natin for responsible gaming.

asr-001050
01:56:10.119 --> 01:56:14.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At kung idadagdag nyo pa, Your Honor,

asr-001051
01:56:14.400 --> 01:56:18.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pwede tayong kumuha nga doon ng budget

asr-001052
01:56:18.079 --> 01:56:23.760
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na magmumula po sa foundations ng iba't ibang online gaming.

asr-001053
01:56:23.760 --> 01:56:26.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, companies or operators.

asr-001054
01:56:26.199 --> 01:56:35.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, kung susumahin nyo po, kung meron pong mahigit sandang billion gross gaming revenue

asr-001055
01:56:35.520 --> 01:56:41.064
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na nagmumula sa online gaming, 1% of that will be about A 134 30audsực

asr-001056
01:56:41.064 --> 01:56:42.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: transformative

asr-001057
01:56:42.599 --> 01:56:50.646
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: so, this amount can be used by the said operators to help in the responsible gaming projects.

asr-001058
01:56:50.646 --> 01:56:52.169
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, this no so.

asr-001059
01:56:52.169 --> 01:56:53.895
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung iyon manou na sa dito rito.

asr-001060
01:56:53.895 --> 01:56:55.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: zo'ng magl mount nga dito.

asr-001061
01:56:55.840 --> 01:56:58.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: social, civic projects po.

asr-001062
01:56:58.840 --> 01:57:00.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tulad po nung inulat din,

asr-001063
01:57:00.599 --> 01:57:03.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bibigyan ko kayo halimbawa,

asr-001064
01:57:03.679 --> 01:57:06.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung 2% po na binagkit kong inabutan ko na

asr-001065
01:57:06.560 --> 01:57:11.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na nagmumula sa land-based operations,

asr-001066
01:57:11.079 --> 01:57:14.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nakapagpatayo po tayo ng isang

asr-001067
01:57:14.560 --> 01:57:16.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Children's Specialty Hospital sa Clark.

asr-001068
01:57:16.599 --> 01:57:19.960
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At yung pera po na yun ay nagmula

asr-001069
01:57:19.960 --> 01:57:23.880
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: doon sa foundation ng integrated resort natin.

asr-001070
01:57:23.880 --> 01:57:26.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ang naging kapartner po natin doon

asr-001071
01:57:26.119 --> 01:57:28.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay ang Bloomberry Foundation

asr-001072
01:57:28.920 --> 01:57:32.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na mas kilala sa integrated resort

asr-001073
01:57:32.360 --> 01:57:34.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na ang pangalan ay Soler.

asr-001074
01:57:34.360 --> 01:57:36.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sila po ay nag-contribute ng

asr-001075
01:57:36.520 --> 01:57:38.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: may gitisang billion piso

asr-001076
01:57:38.920 --> 01:57:41.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para sa pagpapatayo ng ospital.

asr-001077
01:57:41.320 --> 01:57:44.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Partner naman po niya ang PAGCOR

asr-001078
01:57:44.199 --> 01:57:45.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagat ang PAGCOR naman po

asr-001079
01:57:45.920 --> 01:57:49.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nag-provide ng medical equipment para dito.

asr-001080
01:57:49.840 --> 01:57:52.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kailan lang po ininaguruhan nito?

asr-001081
01:57:52.400 --> 01:57:54.119
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Kung hindi ako nagkakamali,

asr-001082
01:57:54.119 --> 01:57:57.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: huling linggo po ng Hulyo

asr-001083
01:57:57.800 --> 01:57:58.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nitong 2026.

asr-001084
01:57:58.599 --> 01:57:59.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Your Honor.

asr-001085
01:57:59.920 --> 01:58:00.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair,

asr-001086
01:58:00.760 --> 01:58:02.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mahingi na lang po tayo muli ng breakdown

asr-001087
01:58:02.800 --> 01:58:07.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nung pagkakagastusan natin ng 100 million pesos.

asr-001088
01:58:07.360 --> 01:58:08.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, pang huling tanong po,

asr-001089
01:58:08.800 --> 01:58:10.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kasama na ba dito halimbawa

asr-001090
01:58:10.920 --> 01:58:13.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung nangangailangan ng treatment

asr-001091
01:58:13.719 --> 01:58:15.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa gambling addiction?

asr-001092
01:58:15.560 --> 01:58:17.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron bang dagdag na support?

asr-001093
01:58:17.840 --> 01:58:19.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalo lalo na nabanggit nyo kanina

asr-001094
01:58:19.040 --> 01:58:21.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na malaking percentage din

asr-001095
01:58:21.360 --> 01:58:23.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga gumagamit.

asr-001096
01:58:23.719 --> 01:58:25.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang nakarehistro pero yung active,

asr-001097
01:58:25.760 --> 01:58:27.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na users ay nanggaling sa mga

asr-001098
01:58:27.719 --> 01:58:30.119
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: low income at minimum wage

asr-001099
01:58:30.119 --> 01:58:31.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: earners at workers natin.

asr-001100
01:58:31.800 --> 01:58:33.599
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron bang ganong tulong

asr-001101
01:58:33.599 --> 01:58:35.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa kanila? Dahil Madam Chair,

asr-001102
01:58:35.360 --> 01:58:38.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na-recognize na rin po ng World Health Organization

asr-001103
01:58:38.400 --> 01:58:41.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na isang public health hazard

asr-001104
01:58:41.400 --> 01:58:43.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang hindi lang po exposure

asr-001105
01:58:43.360 --> 01:58:47.119
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero yung active na

asr-001106
01:58:47.119 --> 01:58:48.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gambling.

asr-001107
01:58:48.000 --> 01:58:49.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho,

asr-001108
01:58:49.719 --> 01:58:52.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nangangailangan talaga, hindi lang sa PAGCOR.

asr-001109
01:58:52.639 --> 01:58:53.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi nyo may

asr-001110
01:58:53.800 --> 01:58:55.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sariling source, may income na pwede

asr-001111
01:58:55.920 --> 01:58:57.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: din gamitin pero naniniwala

asr-001112
01:58:57.920 --> 01:58:59.679
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tayo na nangangailangan

asr-001113
01:58:59.679 --> 01:59:01.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ito ng komprehensibo

asr-001114
01:59:01.639 --> 01:59:03.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at multi-agency na

asr-001115
01:59:03.760 --> 01:59:05.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: approach para matiyak na

asr-001116
01:59:05.760 --> 01:59:07.639
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natutugunan natin kung ano man yung

asr-001117
01:59:07.639 --> 01:59:09.719
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga issue na sumusulpot mula dito

asr-001118
01:59:09.719 --> 01:59:11.679
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang nandyan naman yung stricter

asr-001119
01:59:11.679 --> 01:59:13.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natin na regulatory frameworks

asr-001120
01:59:13.480 --> 01:59:15.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and systems pero at the same time

asr-001121
01:59:15.840 --> 01:59:18.079
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung paano rin natin nababawasan

asr-001122
01:59:18.079 --> 01:59:19.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at napiprevent

asr-001123
01:59:19.880 --> 01:59:22.480
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: yung maaari na

asr-001124
01:59:22.480 --> 01:59:25.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: harm mula po sa gambling.

asr-001125
01:59:25.320 --> 01:59:26.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor,

asr-001126
01:59:26.400 --> 01:59:28.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: tulad ng binanggit ko kanina

asr-001127
01:59:28.639 --> 01:59:29.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang katulong po namin

asr-001128
01:59:29.920 --> 01:59:31.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa pagpapatakbo

asr-001129
01:59:31.400 --> 01:59:33.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng 24-7 hotline

asr-001130
01:59:33.800 --> 01:59:36.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay ang Seagulls

asr-001131
01:59:36.000 --> 01:59:37.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Flock Foundation.

asr-001132
01:59:37.679 --> 01:59:39.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Ito po yung isang non-profit

asr-001133
01:59:39.840 --> 01:59:41.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: organization na

asr-001134
01:59:41.920 --> 01:59:44.639
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: may karanasan po, Your Honor,

asr-001135
01:59:44.639 --> 01:59:47.560
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hindi lang sa

asr-001136
01:59:47.560 --> 01:59:47.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: pagtatraining ng

asr-001137
01:59:47.800 --> 01:59:50.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: mga customer service agents

asr-001138
01:59:50.320 --> 01:59:51.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na sumasagot

asr-001139
01:59:51.800 --> 01:59:54.079
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa 24-7 hotline

asr-001140
01:59:54.079 --> 01:59:54.613
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng PAGCOR.

asr-001141
01:59:54.613 --> 02:00:00.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: hotline ng PAGCOR, pero sila po meron di kanalasan sa rehabilitasyon

asr-001142
02:00:00.320 --> 02:00:08.159
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at meron po tayong ka-tie-up ng mga gambling rehabilitation centers all over the Philippines.

asr-001143
02:00:08.159 --> 02:00:17.400
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At sila po sa Seagulls Flock ang nagre-rekomenda sa PAGCOR kung saan ba nararapat ipadala

asr-001144
02:00:17.400 --> 02:00:23.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung may problemang naglalaro na sinasabi po natin, Your Honor.

asr-001145
02:00:23.040 --> 02:00:27.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay, maraming salamat Madam Chair. At higin na rin po natin yung pinakahuling ulat

asr-001146
02:00:27.440 --> 02:00:33.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating dito sa pagsasagawa natin ng mas pinalakas na helpline para sa ating mga kababayan

asr-001147
02:00:33.320 --> 02:00:38.119
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang 24-7 National Problem Gambling Helpline. Maraming salamat Madam Chair.

asr-001148
02:00:38.119 --> 02:00:40.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Maraming salamat din po, Your Honor.

asr-001149
02:00:40.679 --> 02:00:48.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Representative Elago. We'll consolidate the whole list of the documentary requests

asr-001150
02:00:48.320 --> 02:00:52.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to PAGCOR and then we'll follow up.

asr-001151
02:00:52.040 --> 02:00:54.599
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll follow up with them later on. Thank you.

asr-001152
02:00:54.599 --> 02:01:00.679
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll move to our next interpellator from the majority, Representative Salvador Pleyto.

asr-001153
02:01:02.500 --> 02:01:03.750
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Good morning, Madam. Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001154
02:01:03.760 --> 02:01:13.848
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Sa ating colleagues and our esteemed guests, Chairman Alteco, sa ating PAGCOR family,

asr-001155
02:01:17.898 --> 02:01:19.383
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

asr-001156
02:01:20.058 --> 02:01:22.960
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Dalawang tanong lang po, Madam Chair.

asr-001157
02:01:25.400 --> 02:01:28.934
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: I reported that the total revenues, I don't know kung tama yung akin o yung sinabi ni Chairman kanina,

asr-001158
02:01:33.254 --> 02:01:34.891
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Chairman Mika, ng first half of 2026,

asr-001159
02:01:34.891 --> 02:01:37.430
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: nag-decline ng 26.64%,

asr-001160
02:01:39.310 --> 02:01:43.614
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: while PAGCOR's net income ay bumaba o nag-fail ng 85.29%.

asr-001161
02:01:43.614 --> 02:01:46.320
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Tama po ba ito, Chairman Al?

asr-001162
02:01:48.310 --> 02:01:51.709
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yes, Your Honor. Tama po yung binanggit nyo.

asr-001163
02:01:51.709 --> 02:01:52.781
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Tulad po ng aking pagpapaliwanag earlier,

asr-001164
02:01:52.781 --> 02:01:57.217
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung ano po yung mga kadahilanan ng pagbaba na yun sa pangkasalukuyan.

asr-001165
02:01:59.123 --> 02:02:02.669
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Madam Chair, Chairman Al, in light of this significant decline,

asr-001166
02:02:07.662 --> 02:02:10.790
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: ano po, what concrete measures will PAGCOR implement to reverse this trend

asr-001167
02:02:13.709 --> 02:02:18.698
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and increase gross gaming revenue to JGR, particularly sa electronic at online gaming sector?

asr-001168
02:02:19.323 --> 02:02:21.972
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001169
02:02:21.972 --> 02:02:22.664
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor.

asr-001170
02:02:23.960 --> 02:02:25.432
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Your Honor, tulad po nung naiulot ko kanina,

asr-001171
02:02:30.910 --> 02:02:33.790
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: una, malakas po ang programa namin ngayon sa paghihikayat sa mga iligal na operator

asr-001172
02:02:39.303 --> 02:02:39.958
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na magpalisensya na.

asr-001173
02:02:41.950 --> 02:02:44.320
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil ang paniwala ko po sa pangkasalukuyan sa industriya,

asr-001174
02:02:47.200 --> 02:02:49.030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% po ang may lisensya,

asr-001175
02:02:54.035 --> 02:02:55.807
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 50% din po ang walang lisensya.

asr-001176
02:02:55.807 --> 02:02:57.578
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, very positive naman, Your Honor, ang aming programa

asr-001177
02:03:00.835 --> 02:03:03.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat meron na po kaming mga natatanggap ng mga feelers

asr-001178
02:03:05.790 --> 02:03:09.863
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para mag-surrender na ang ilang malalaking iligal na magpalisensya na po sa pangkasalukuyan.

asr-001179
02:03:12.344 --> 02:03:13.272
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So, number one po yun.

asr-001180
02:03:15.669 --> 02:03:24.280
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Number two, tulad nung binanggit ko kanina sa katanungan ni Congressman Odi earlier,

asr-001181
02:03:29.069 --> 02:03:32.239
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: aming pong minomonitor ng husto ang income na or GGR or operations ngayon

asr-001182
02:03:36.270 --> 02:03:38.920
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ng mga online gaming companies sa pamamagitan ng isang third-party auditor.

asr-001183
02:03:42.179 --> 02:03:50.030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po ay aming nakikita kung tunay pang nairimit nila or dinideklara nila yung tama nilang gross gaming revenue.

asr-001184
02:03:52.861 --> 02:03:54.025
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At gusto ko pong ibalita sa inyo,

asr-001185
02:03:57.502 --> 02:04:02.270
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: malaki na rin po ang naging pagtaas ng mga gross gaming revenue ng online gaming operators

asr-001186
02:04:05.790 --> 02:04:11.440
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: dahil naalaman nila at nakikita nilang nakatutok ang isang third-party auditor.

asr-001187
02:04:16.199 --> 02:04:22.830
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At panghuli po ay nag-ikayat kami na sana'y marami pang mag-apply dito sa special class BPO

asr-001188
02:04:26.730 --> 02:04:28.575
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kung saan po yung mga nasa ibang bansa na mga malalaking operator ay gamitin na ang Pilipinas

asr-001189
02:04:35.673 --> 02:04:41.030
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bilang kanilang mga backroom operations ay dito na gawin sa Maynila.

asr-001190
02:04:44.887 --> 02:04:49.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Very encouraging, Your Honor, Kong Ador, itong binabanggit ko sapagkat sa ngayon po eh,

asr-001191
02:04:52.709 --> 02:04:55.062
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nasa sa nung linunsad po namin yung programa, two-fold po,

asr-001192
02:04:55.062 --> 02:05:03.599
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: bukod sa may karagdagang kita sa PAGCOR, may himigit kumulang po sa 7,500 empleyado na

asr-001193
02:05:07.567 --> 02:05:10.800
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang nasabing sektor nito na hindi nagbabayad ng minimum wage,

asr-001194
02:05:13.790 --> 02:05:19.651
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: kundi nagbabayad ng mga rates ng customer service agents ng mga BPO.

asr-001195
02:05:19.651 --> 02:05:21.033
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So this amounts to an average of...

asr-001196
02:05:23.969 --> 02:05:25.049
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: 35,000 to 45,000 pesos a month.

asr-001197
02:05:26.510 --> 02:05:29.234
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: So yun po ang aming ginagawa sa pangkasulukuyan,

asr-001198
02:05:29.538 --> 02:05:31.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: and we're also hoping, Your Honor, Kong Ador,

asr-001199
02:05:34.111 --> 02:05:37.520
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na dumating yung pagkakataon na matapos na rin yung crisis sa Middle East,

asr-001200
02:05:38.937 --> 02:05:41.990
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nang sa ganun eh, medyo pag nakaluwag-luwag naman sila eh,

asr-001201
02:05:44.079 --> 02:05:46.109
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ang tao eh, marami na rin ang magpe-patronize ng ating mga naroon.

asr-001202
02:05:46.531 --> 02:05:50.840
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Chairman Al, for that response.

asr-001203
02:05:57.348 --> 02:06:00.950
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Specifically, what is PAGCOR's strategy in terms of improving its regulatory framework,

asr-001204
02:06:04.047 --> 02:06:07.507
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: expanding the legitimate gaming market, strengthening its digital monitoring and collection system,

asr-001205
02:06:09.790 --> 02:06:11.679
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and addressing illegal and unlicensed operators,

asr-001206
02:06:15.033 --> 02:06:19.690
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and also attracting responsible investment into the Philippine gaming industry.

asr-001207
02:06:20.146 --> 02:06:23.500
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Okay.

asr-001208
02:06:23.500 --> 02:06:24.736
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Doon po sa katanungan ninyo, Your Honor, una,

asr-001209
02:06:28.440 --> 02:06:32.149
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sa structure po, wala pong sawa kaming nagre-review ng aming structures and guidelines regularly

asr-001210
02:06:38.185 --> 02:06:39.095
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para nang sa ganun ma-improve ito.

asr-001211
02:06:43.467 --> 02:06:48.549
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yan po ay patutunayan ng updated structure ng online gaming rules ng PAGCOR.

asr-001212
02:06:56.040 --> 02:06:59.549
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halos po buwan-buwan, meron po kaming mga adjustments na ginagawa

asr-001213
02:07:00.730 --> 02:07:06.910
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: para ito po ay matama at maging ma-responsive sa pangkasulukuyang sitwasyon.

asr-001214
02:07:11.530 --> 02:07:19.679
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Number two, kami po ay patuloy na dumalabas at nagsasabi,

asr-001215
02:07:20.990 --> 02:07:30.002
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: nag-a-attend sa mga konbensyon, ngayon din naman ang mga exhibits abroad,

asr-001216
02:07:30.002 --> 02:07:32.573
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: at nagsasabing bukas ang Pilipinas sa paglilesensya ng land-based casinos,

asr-001217
02:07:33.738 --> 02:07:37.830
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ngayon din naman ng ating online gaming.

asr-001218
02:07:40.870 --> 02:07:45.061
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Hindi man dapat sabihin, pero pwede na rin ipagmalaki na dito po sa Asia,

asr-001219
02:07:45.213 --> 02:07:51.237
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: ay next to Macau.

asr-001220
02:07:53.414 --> 02:07:55.051
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Halos we are competing.

asr-001221
02:07:55.490 --> 02:07:56.975
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Head to head na with Singapore.

asr-001222
02:07:56.975 --> 02:07:58.460
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And I believe, malaking bagay po itong darating na privatization,

asr-001223
02:08:02.240 --> 02:08:04.199
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: sapagkat pagdakailam na po at ang nagpatakbo na po ng mga kasino

asr-001224
02:08:06.982 --> 02:08:09.040
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: na sa pangkasulukuyan ay pinapatakbo ng PAGCOR,

asr-001225
02:08:10.510 --> 02:08:13.000
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naniniwala po ko it will be a game changer.

asr-001226
02:08:15.760 --> 02:08:18.360
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Sapagkat pag ang pribadong sektor na ang nagpapatakbo ng negosyo,

asr-001227
02:08:19.958 --> 02:08:21.410
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: iba na po ito eh.

asr-001228
02:08:23.485 --> 02:08:28.950
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Eh sa pangkasulukuyan, your honor, we cannot compete head on with our licenses.

asr-001229
02:08:32.229 --> 02:08:39.162
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Yung kasino Filipino, your honor, wala man lang kaming kwarto na mga hotel na inalok.

asr-001230
02:08:39.432 --> 02:08:44.819
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Wala kaming mga restaurants, wala kaming mga mall, wala kaming mga prebileyong maipagkaloob.

asr-001231
02:08:44.819 --> 02:08:47.792
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Dahil wala namang yung mga properties natin.

asr-001232
02:08:47.792 --> 02:08:50.300
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Na ganitong facilities.

asr-001233
02:08:53.950 --> 02:09:00.819
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Pero pag ang kasino Filipino po at itong mga properties natin ay na-privatize na,

asr-001234
02:09:00.819 --> 02:09:02.840
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: naniniwala po ako, yung bibili ng pribadong kumpanya,

asr-001235
02:09:03.750 --> 02:09:06.770
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: eh magagawa na ng hakbang yan para lumakas ang kanilang kasino.

asr-001236
02:09:09.672 --> 02:09:13.109
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: At pag lumakas ang kasino, sapagkat tayo ay mga umalik tala lang ng license fees,

asr-001237
02:09:15.663 --> 02:09:17.317
