asr-004143
04:35:07.561 --> 04:35:09.959
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: And recently, most recently...

asr-004144
04:35:09.959 --> 04:35:18.719
PAGCOR Chairman and CEO Alejandro H. Tengco: Just in the last week of July, we inaugurated a multi-specialty hospital in Clark.

asr-004145
